&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# e_2 = 60737
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# n = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="phân-tích"&gt;Phân tích:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bài cho dữ kiện gồm 2 ct, 2 e tương ứng và n. Với những dữ kiện này thì nghĩ ngay đến &lt;code&gt;Common Modulus Attack&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HTB Apocalypse 2025</title><link>https://deroise2306.github.io/posts/htb-apocalypse-2025/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://deroise2306.github.io/posts/htb-apocalypse-2025/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1-copperbox"&gt;1. Copperbox&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="challenge"&gt;Challenge:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cedric found a mysterious box made of pure copper in the old archive. He is convinced that it contains the secrets he is looking for, but he is unable to penetrate the metal case. Can you help?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Source:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;import secrets
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;p = 0x31337313373133731337313373133731337313373133731337313373133732ad
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;a = 0xdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeef
